templaros (0.1.0~dev0+g0000000) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Placeholder. This entry is GENERATED: run `cargo xtask archive changelog --write
    <tree>/debian/changelog` against a disposable copy of the source tree before building the
    source package, and the head entry becomes the build-set id every .deb already carries.
  * Do not edit by hand and do not commit a generated entry: the id contains `.dirty` when the
    working tree has uncommitted changes, so writing it into the checkout would change the id it
    was derived from. See @templaros.decision.build-set-id-is-the-version-authority and ci/source-build.sh.
  * The project's history up to this point is the git history; M0 shipped the workspace, daemons,
    session units and distro layer.

